Четвертая Задача:

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        java.util.Scanner scanner = new java.util.Scanner(System.in);
        long rubl = scanner.nextLong();
        long kopeika = scanner.nextLong();
        long amount = scanner.nextLong();

    
        long totalCost = (rubl * 100 + kopeika) * amount;
        rubl = totalCost / 100; 
        kopeika = totalCost % 100;

        System.out.println(rubl + " " + kopeika);
    }
}

Пятая Задача:

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        java.util.Scanner scanner = new java.util.Scanner(System.in);
        long totalTime = scanner.nextLong();
        
        long userHours = (totalTime / 3600) % 24;
        long userMinutes = (totalTime / 60) % 60;
        long userSeconds = totalTime % 60;
        
        System.out.printf("%d:%02d:%02d\n", userHours, userMinutes, userSeconds);
    }
}
